 "teaches": [
  "One GalleryGrid call with aspect 0.75 (4:3 photos): each photo is {section?, title, caption, art}; the component owns the columns (2, 3, 4, 6 as the window widens), the tile size, the headings and the scrolling",
  "art is any node that fills its box: here Snapshot, a component defined in the document under components, draws a stand-in photo (sky gradient, sun, hills, sea or skyline) from a few colours. A real app passes a canvas with drawScaledBitmap",
  "Select, then act: a tap sets sel and rings the photo; the Share button in headerEnd is written once and sends hostNamedAction sharePhoto with sel, so the host action name is used once and the bytes match the Java parser"
 ],
